1836:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @brief  HELPER macro calculating the auto-reload value, with dithering feature enabled, to achi
1837:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note ex: @ref __LL_TIM_CALC_PULSE_DITHER (1000000, @ref LL_TIM_GetPrescaler (), 10, 20);
