1261:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_exti.h ****   *       resulting in an interrupt request generation.
1262:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_exti.h ****   *       This bit is cleared by clearing the corresponding bit in the EXTI_PR1
1263:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_exti.h ****   *       register (by writing a 1 into the bit)
